          "filename": "Wadi Hayl2.jpg",
          "caption": "The fortified residence at Wadi Hayl housed the ruling family of Fujairah for over 20 years. A watchtower on the hillside above the house provided excellent views along the wadi and over its valuable date palm plantations. The wadi has many fine petroglyphs (rock art), and further examples can be found in Fujairah museum. The residence buildings have been restored.",
